<title>JAPAN: Japan August household spending flat yr/yr - EPA.</title>
<headline>Japan August household spending flat yr/yr - EPA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's household spending was unchanged in August in real terms from a year earlier at an average 327,623 yen per household, the government's Management and Coordination Agency said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>A breakdown of year-on-year percentage changes in real and nominal terms follows:</p>
<p>					 AUGUST	     JULY</p>
<p>				    Real  Nominal    Real  Nominal</p>
<p>Overall household spending  0.0   +0.1	 -4.4   -4.1</p>
<p>(average 327,623 yen)</p>
<p>Spending by wage earners   +2.4   +2.5	 -5.1   -4.8</p>
<p>(average 352,077 yen)</p>
</text>
